{{Quote | ''Focus and relax to the sound of crashing waves...''}}
[[File:BattlebgBeach.png|thumb]]

Beach is one of the [[Field Effects]] present in Rejuvenation. It is classified as a Telluric field and can be found on [[Route 5]].

==General Effects==

* Wind-based moves, Air Slash, Fire Spin & Leaf Tornado additionally lower the Accuracy of all Pokémon on the field by 1 stage.
** ''"The sand was stirred up from the ground!"''
*** Fire Spin lowers Accuracy when used, not at the end of the turn.
* Fighting-type Pokémon are prevented from becoming afflicted with confusion.
** ''"[Pokémon] broke through the confusion!"''
* Sandstorm lasts for 8 turns.

==Abilities Affected==

===Activated Abilities===

* Sand Force
* Sand Rush
* Sand Veil
* Zen Mode
** This only applies to Unovan Darmanitan.

===Buffed Abilities===

* Inner Focus prevents the bearer from becoming afflicted with confusion
** ''"[Pokémon] broke through the confusion!"''
* Sand Spit lowers attackers' accuracy by 1 stage on activation.
* Water Compaction additionally raises Special Defense by 2 stages on activation.

===Other Ability Changes===

* Inner Focus, Own Tempo, Pure Power, Sand Veil, Stalwart & Steadfast cause the bearer to ignore all Accuracy and Evasion changes when attacking, beneficial or not. This does not apply if the target's ability is As One or Unnerve.
** As of V14.0.22, As One is not mentionned in the in-game Field Notes.

==Moves Affected==

===Damage Modifiers===

====Moves which receive an attack buff====

* Sand Tomb → 2x boost, lowers the target's accuracy at the end of the turn.
** ''"Sand mixed into the attack!"''
* [[Mud Barrage]], Mud Bomb, Mud Shot, Mud Slap, → 2x boost.
** ''"Sand mixed into the attack!"''
* Strength → 1.5x boost, becomes Fighting-type, Psychic sub-typing.
** ''"...And with pure focus!"''
* Brine, Clangorous Soulblaze, Crabhammer, Hidden Power, Land's Wrath, Muddy Water, Razor Shell, Sandsear Storm, Scorching Sands, Shell Side Arm, Shell Trap, Smelling Salts, Surf, Thousand Waves, Wave Crash → 1.5x boost.
** ''"The salty sea strengthened the attack!"''
** ''"...And with pure focus!"''
** ''"Time for crab!"''
** ''"The sand strengthened the atttack!"''
** ''"Surf's up!"''
** ''"A shining shell on the beach!"''
* Focus Blast → 1.3x boost, 90% Accuracy.
** ''"...And with full focus...!"''
* Aura Sphere, Focus Punch, Stored Power, Zen Headbutt → 1.3x boost.
** ''"...And with full focus...!"''
* Psychic → 1.2x boost.
** ''"...And with focus...!"''

===Other Moves===

====Buffed Moves====

* [[Arenite Wall]] lasts 8 turns and can be set regardless of weather.
* Calm Mind boosts the user's Special Attack and Special Defense by 2 stages.
* Focus Blast's accuracy is increased to 90%.
* Focus Energy raises the user's Critical Hit rate by 3 stages.
** A +3 Crit rate translates to guaranteed critical hits.
* Kinesis and Sand Attack lower the target's Accuracy by 2 stages.
* Meditate raises the user's Attack by 3 stages.
* Psych Up additionally cures the user's non-volatile status.
* Sand Tomb additionally lowers the trapped Pokémon's Accuracy by 1 stage each turn.
* Shore Up fully restores the user's HP.

===Field-dependent moves & Abilities===

* Mimicry changes the bearer's type to Ground.
* Camouflage changes the user's type to Ground.
* Nature Power becomes Meditate.
* Secret Power may lower Accuracy.
* Shelter halves damage from Ground-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes Ground.

==Items==

* [[Telluric Seed]] applies Focus Energy to the user.
** ''"[Pokémon]'s Telluric Seed is getting it pumped!"''
* Shell Bell's recovery is doubled to 25% of the damage dealt.

==Notes==

* Prior to V14, Razor Wind, Sand Tomb, Twister and Whirlpool also lowered the accuracy of all Pokémon on the field. Additionally, instead of Wind-based moves, Special Flying-type moves were the ones with that effect.

